WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
The one fan that actually keeps you cold

00:00:01.941 --> 00:00:04.821
because it actually is air conditioning on the inside.

00:00:04.822 --> 00:00:07.061
It's the one thing that people forget to tell you to pack

00:00:07.062 --> 00:00:07.981
for a theme car.

00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:10.621
Not only does the fan literally have condensation on it

00:00:10.622 --> 00:00:12.061
from blowing out that cold air,

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:13.141
but the air is actually cold

00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:16.381
because it passes through these metal pieces on the inside.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.861
And probably one of my favorite parts

00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:19.821
is actually being able to put this on my wrist

00:00:19.822 --> 00:00:21.261
and keeping my wrist cool.

00:00:21.262 --> 00:00:23.181
The literally cool me down while I'm in that hot,

00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:23.941
hot sun.

00:00:23.942 --> 00:00:27.101
I always forget how absolutely brutal the weather is in the theme park

00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:28.061
until I'm actually there.

00:00:28.062 --> 00:00:29.941
So I'm gonna have this cooling fan link for you down below.

00:00:29.942 --> 00:00:31.741
This is typically the Pro version of it

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:34.901
and my absolute favorite because it literally doesn't turn on my bag

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:36.741
because it's the dial button on the side.

00:00:36.742 --> 00:00:38.861
Hopefully it's still in stock by the time you see this video,

00:00:38.862 --> 00:00:41.015
cause this fan has been going absolutely viral.
